</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.32</h2><ul><li><strong>A shorter limit that states its length shows when it may run out.</strong> With Show the estimate on under Settings → Usage, that limit, including Kimi Code&#x27;s five-hour limit, writes the time under its own row when the current pace runs out before its reset. A weekly limit with no stated length still says it is expected to last while less than a quarter is spent, and stays quiet once a quarter is spent. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/94">#94</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.32">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
